{"unit_id":"kirkchinese__CiteCiter#feature-1","repo":"kirkchinese/CiteCiter","commit":"0ba0e4c452e945a7b775702a83e8f0997760a678","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CiteCiter 的功能「引用回答并追问」：从主对话选中助手回答，创建带来源会话和序号锚点的引用，再在独立 Topic 中追问；Host 会对照已提交的原始消息解析选中文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/citeciter/src/client/index.ts:180-225","packages/citeciter/src/observer.ts:78-138"]}
{"unit_id":"kirkchinese__CiteCiter#feature-2","repo":"kirkchinese/CiteCiter","commit":"0ba0e4c452e945a7b775702a83e8f0997760a678","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CiteCiter 的功能「阅读来源会话」：Topic 中的 Agent 可调用 read_source_session，按事件序号读取原会话的用户、助手和工具记录；结果分页并提供继续读取位置，较长工具内容可按需读取完整版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/citeciter/src/source-read-tool.ts:34-55"]}
{"unit_id":"kirkchinese__CiteCiter#feature-3","repo":"kirkchinese/CiteCiter","commit":"0ba0e4c452e945a7b775702a83e8f0997760a678","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CiteCiter 的功能「引用工具结果」：用户可从主对话工具结果选择证据；Host 根据已提交的工具调用与结果核对会话、调用 ID 和文本投影，再把验证后的证据放入 Topic。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/citeciter/src/observer.ts:141-155","packages/citeciter/src/client/index.ts:180-225"]}
{"unit_id":"kirkchinese__CiteCiter#feature-4","repo":"kirkchinese/CiteCiter","commit":"0ba0e4c452e945a7b775702a83e8f0997760a678","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CiteCiter 的功能「搜索和阅读文档」：在 Topic 附加文档后，Agent 可搜索最多 20 处不区分大小写的匹配，再按 UTF-16 偏移分段读取，单次读取最多返回 50 KiB。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/citeciter/src/document-tools.ts:10-57","packages/citeciter/src/document-tools.ts:83-141"]}
{"unit_id":"kirkchinese__CiteCiter#feature-5","repo":"kirkchinese/CiteCiter","commit":"0ba0e4c452e945a7b775702a83e8f0997760a678","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CiteCiter 的功能「生成可视化板书」：Topic Agent 可用 blackboard_apply 添加、更新或移除文字、公式、SVG、图片等板书元素；还可用 blackboard_animate 为已有元素编排可播放的时间线。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/citeciter/src/blackboard-tool.ts:120-183"]}
{"unit_id":"kirkchinese__CiteCiter#feature-6","repo":"kirkchinese/CiteCiter","commit":"0ba0e4c452e945a7b775702a83e8f0997760a678","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CiteCiter 的功能「整理学习卡片」：Topic Agent 可调用 learning_cards 保存一组 1–8 张学习卡，卡片包含标题、摘要、例子、问题和答案；新卡组替换当前展示组，旧记录仍保留在 Topic 日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/citeciter/src/learning-cards-tool.ts:7-42"]}
{"unit_id":"kirkchinese__CiteCiter#feature-7","repo":"kirkchinese/CiteCiter","commit":"0ba0e4c452e945a7b775702a83e8f0997760a678","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CiteCiter 的功能「补充回合上下文」：启用自动来源摘录时，插件可在每轮开始加入来源会话的新记录；还可按设置附加 Topic 工作区的变更摘要或差异，并将上下文写入 Topic 日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/citeciter/src/topic-context.ts:1-5","packages/citeciter/src/topic-context.ts:22-30","packages/citeciter/src/topic-context.ts:80-130"]}
